+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/7a7fc491-b385-4714-90e3-b613d7aae221", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "7a7fc491-b385-4714-90e3-b613d7aae221", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"7a7fc491-b385-4714-90e3-b613d7aae221\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/7a7fc491-b385-4714-90e3-b613d7aae221\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+ax+b\"></span> . Най­ди­те <i>k</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-1</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем дан­ную функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{kx+a}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb+a-kb}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb}{x+b}+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}=k+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  –1, зна­чит, <i>k</i>  =  –1.</p>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}